{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920880/extras/char_showcase_0.png?t=1748617704\" /></div><strong>THIS GAME IS DESIGNED TO BE ENJOYED FOR ABOUT 5 HOURS</strong>  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">---------------------------------</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Chase Fox's sixth game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Truth Universally Acknowledged is a Dating Sim game that lets you play as a teenageer named Talay and help him win the heart of 4 different love interests. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A new school year comes with a new student, Talay. You are Talay and Talay is you. Help them win the heart of 4 romanceable characters in this whimsical school.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Genre</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Romantic Comedy,  Dating Sim, Visual novel </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Original Art, Music &amp; Sound Design</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Four Romanceable Characters</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920880/extras/char_showcase_1.png?t=1748617704\" /></div></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><u>Miy</u></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A very cheerful person with cooking skills that is quite extraordinary. He works as a cook at a cafe located in a sunflower field.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920880/extras/char_showcase_3.png?t=1748617704\" /></div></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><u>Courtney</u></i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">He is a bookmaker, magical individual who imbues a book with so much magic through their writing and makes the book comes alive. He is very quiet and tend to keep to himself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920880/extras/char_showcase_4.png?t=1748617704\" /></div></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u>Kit</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A detective who specialized in treasure hunting. He sometimes forgets to take off his detective hat when he is not on the job. He is also quite shy and awkward individual.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920880/extras/char_showcase_5.png?t=1748617704\" /></div></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><i>August</i></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An annoyingly charming a famous celebrity who is mischievous and playful in nature. Because he is famous, the closer you are with him, closer you are to scandal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-------------------------------------------------------------------------</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Reaction Mechanics</strong><br>In this game you could react to every line of dialogue in the game and the characters will react accordingly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920880/extras/steam_page_about_me_asset5.png?t=1748617704\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>True Story Mode</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience the stories of the 4 romanceable characters. 32 endings are waiting for you to explore. 8 endings for each of the 4 routes for each romanceable characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920880/extras/steam_page_about_me_asset7.png?t=1748617704\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Side Story Mode</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience short little stories where you will get to learn more about the characters and the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920880/extras/steam_page_about_me_asset9.png?t=1748617704\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dress-Up</strong><br>    Dress Talay up as you wish. While doing that you might also want to fill Talay's confidence bar to maximize the chance of them winning the heart of the romancable characters. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920880/extras/screenshot11.png?t=1748617704\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>32 endings</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game has 32 endings, 4 for each romanceable characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>40 Cgs</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920880/extras/steam_page_about_me_asset4.png?t=1748617704\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">---------------------------------<br><br>Story, Art, Music and Sound Design<br>by ChaseFOX<br><br>Proofread and Developmental Writing<br>by Eskay<br><br>---------------------------------</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.s